flowchart TB
    subgraph Local["Local execution — Docker + LocalStack ($0 cloud spend)"]
        TF["Terraform IaC"]
        OPA["Conftest / OPA Rego policy gate"]
        AWS["LocalStack AWS APIs"]
        CT["CloudTrail audit trail"]
        EB["EventBridge security bus"]
        SQS["SQS security queue + DLQ"]
        IAM["IAM users and role chain"]
        KMS["KMS audit key"]
        S3["Encrypted S3 audit and forensics buckets"]
        SM["Secrets Manager"]
        VPC["VPC, subnets and security groups"]

        TF --> OPA
        OPA -->|policy pass| AWS
        AWS --> IAM
        AWS --> KMS
        AWS --> S3
        AWS --> SM
        AWS --> VPC
        AWS --> CT
        CT -.->|native event integration tested; LocalStack limitation observed| EB
        EB --> SQS
    end

    subgraph Defense["Control-plane defense services"]
        DET["Stateful CloudTrail detector\nAssumeRole graph + kill-chain rules"]
        SOAR["SOAR responder\nDry-run / explicit execute"]
        DRIFT["Terraform-state drift reconciler\nForensic snapshot + targeted rollback"]
        TEST["Pytest adversarial and regression suite"]
    end

    SQS --> DET
    DET -->|HIGH / CRITICAL alert| SOAR
    AWS -->|live state inspection| DRIFT
    TF -->|approved baseline| DRIFT
    DRIFT -->|verified remediation| AWS
    TEST --> DET
    TEST --> SOAR
    TEST --> DRIFT
